530
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:50,160
我想请你帮我一个大忙
which is why I have to ask you a really big favor.

531
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,580
你能去跟别的女生好吗
Can you pick another girl?

532
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:54,820
像你这样 什么女生都会喜欢你
I mean, you can have anyone you want,

533
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,360
但我只有克莱尔了
but... Claire's all I've got.

534
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:58,600
失去她 我就失去了一切
I'd be lost without her.

535
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:00,320
我自己都不知道我当初怎么泡到她的
I don't even know how I got her in the first place.

536
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,080
你的确挺傻的
You are pretty silly.

537
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:03,316
那你怎么说
What do you say?

538
00:19:03,316 --> 00:19:06,750
爷们之间的约定 你愿意收手吗
Dude to dude, will you back off?

539
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:09,640
好吧
Okay.

540
00:19:11,423 --> 00:19:13,220
海莉有在跟人交往吗
Is Haley seeing anyone?

541
00:19:13,220 --> 00:19:13,660
你悠着点
Easy.

542
00:19:25,941 --> 00:19:28,580
我怎么回到阿尔文身边的 我也不知道
How'd I get back to Arvin? I don't know.

543
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:29,960
我本来是在找停车场
I was just looking for the parking lot

544
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,560
结果遇到了一个岔路
when I came to a fork in the path.

545
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,240
如果我选了另一条
Had I taken the other path,

546
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:35,840
或许我已经上了我的车回家了
I would've just gotten in my car and gone home.

547
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:37,280
可是呢...
Instead...

548
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,180
你回来啦
You came back!

549
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,300
靠 还真是
Damn it, I did!

550
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,420
你为什么跑掉啊 我做什么了
Why did you run off? What did I do?

551
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,919
你什么都做到了 而我一事无成
Everything. And I've done nothing.

552
00:19:48,919 --> 00:19:50,820
我感觉自己就是个废柴
I-I feel like a loser.

553
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:52,300
你觉得自己是废柴吗
You feel like a loser?

554
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:55,618
你觉得我为什么这么讨人厌在自卖自夸呢
Why do you think I went on about myself so appallingly?

555
00:19:55,618 --> 00:19:56,703
快看我
Ooh, look at me.

556
00:19:56,703 --> 00:19:58,950
我在应用臭屁学领域
I won the Von Snootington Award

557
00:19:58,950 --> 00:20:01,240
赢得了"炊扭比"大奖呢
for Applied Astro-Doofinomics.

558
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,863
你又赢了一个奖吗 这怎么安慰到我了
You won another award? How is this helping?

559
00:20:03,863 --> 00:20:06,600
海莉 我喜欢你
Haley...I like you.

560
00:20:06,881 --> 00:20:09,669
你的强大与难以对付
You are formidable in a way that's...

561
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:14,580
与别人好不一样 令我斗志十足
that's different and exciting to me.

562
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:16,600
我也是这感觉
Yeah, well, same,

563
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,740
但感觉就是不合理啊
but it just doesn't make sense.

564
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,520
我就喜欢不合理的事情
I love things that don't make sense.

565
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:21,880
这是我的强项
That's my gig. ?

566
00:20:22,460 --> 00:20:24,000
我们一起来把它理理顺吧
Let's figure this out together.

567
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:25,880
来嘛
Come on.

568
00:20:25,940 --> 00:20:27,380
我能怎么做
What can I do?

569
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:34,860
这挺有帮助
That helps.

570
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:44,060
一想到如果我走了另一边
Oh, it's so weird to think that if I had taken another path,

571
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:45,420
我现在可能已经到家了就好怪
I could be heading home right now.

572
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:48,160
等等 这就像你之前说的一样
Wait a minute. It's like what you said before.

573
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:52,140
在另一个不同的宇宙 你可能跟别人在一起了
In a different universe, you could be with someone else.

574
00:21:03,696 --> 00:21:05,580
我们... 我们能换首歌吗
Um, could we... could we change this song?

575
00:21:05,580 --> 00:21:08,740
这歌的氛围有点破坏我蓝调的做爱风格
The poppy cadence is throwing off my more bluesy lovemaking style.

576
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,080
你们都不敲门的吗
Don't you ever knock?!

577
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:14,020
这是我的卧室
This is my bedroom!

578
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:16,140
我真不敢相信这种事又发生了一次
I can't believe this is happening again!

579
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:16,940
又发生吗
Again?

580
00:21:17,053 --> 00:21:19,540
我真希望我当时被逮捕走了
I wish I had gotten arrested!

581
00:21:19,540 --> 00:21:20,179
妈 你在哪
Mom, where are you?

582
00:21:20,179 --> 00:21:21,450
我给你做了张情人节卡...
I made you a Valen...

583
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:26,680
我不在的这些时候 你们都在搞什么鬼啊
What kind of freak show goes on here when I'm not around?
